{"Title":"An Act designating a portion of state highway Route 7A in the town of Lenox as the Ross B. Dindio Memorial highway","BillNumber":"H5118","DocketNumber":"HD5469","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"WSP1","Name":"Smitty Pignatelli","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WSP1","ResponseDate":"2024-11-01T11:23:03.03"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"WSP1","Name":"Smitty Pignatelli","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WSP1","ResponseDate":"2024-11-01T11:23:03.0466667"},{"Id":"PWM0","Name":"Paul W. Mark","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PWM0","ResponseDate":"2024-11-04T12:36:23.14"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"PWM0","Name":"Paul W. Mark","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PWM0","ResponseDate":"2024-11-01T11:23:03.03"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H5118/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Pignatelli of Lenox and Senator Mark, a joint petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Smitty Pignatelli and Paul W. Mark that the Massachusetts Department of Transportation be directed to designate a portion of state highway Route 7A in the town of Lenox as the Ross B. Dindio memorial highway.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tThe portion of state highway route 7A in the town of Lenox from mile marker 2 to mile marker 2.62 shall be designated and known as the Ross B. Dindio Memorial highway. The Massachusetts Department of Transportation is hereby directed to erect and maintain suitable markers along said highway bearing said designation in accordance with the standards of the department.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"